            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Supponi che <code>data_tools</code> sia già installato. Completa la parola chiave che importa questo pacchetto di terze parti installato.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" data_tools\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"require\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"helpers\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"script\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>import</code>, seguito da <code>data_tools</code>.</p></body></html>"
