      {
        "id": 17788,
        "title": "Usare i file dei requisiti",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Share the package list",
            "id": 151751,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando pip installa un pacchetto, aggiunge il pacchetto all'ambiente attivo. Un ambiente è la configurazione Python attualmente usata per eseguire il codice.</p><p>Un collega o un agente di programmazione usa un altro ambiente. Senza gli stessi pacchetti, il codice non può essere eseguito.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tabulate\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = [\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alice&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Vienna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"],\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bob&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Berlin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"],\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Charlie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"28\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;London&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"],\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(tabulate.tabulate(data, headers=[\" /><text value=\"&quot;Name&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Age&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;City&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]))\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Name       Age  City\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------  -----  ------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Alice       25  Vienna\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Bob         30  Berlin\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Charlie     28  London\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Share the package list - Copy",
            "id": 151781,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Python offre una soluzione con <code>requirements.txt</code>, un file di testo che elenca i pacchetti necessari a un progetto.<br /></p><p>Nel file <code>requirements.txt</code>, specifichiamo tutti i pacchetti di terze parti di cui abbiamo bisogno.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"text\" name=\"requirements.txt\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"tabulate\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"random\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>tabulate</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Share the package list - Copy 2",
            "id": 151782,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ogni riga indica un pacchetto obbligatorio. Possiamo usarne quanti ne servono o desideriamo.</p><p>Non elenchiamo <code>random</code> o <code>math</code> in <code>requirements.txt</code>, anche se li usiamo, perché fanno parte della libreria standard di Python.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"text\" name=\"requirements.txt\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"tabulate\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"flask\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pandas\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"numpy\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
